New Download Manager keeps downloading while its window is minimized. To quit, use Tasks → Exit.=New Download Manager sigue descargando con la ventana minimizada. Para salir, use Tareas → Salir.
New Download Manager restarts by itself when the update is installed.=New Download Manager se reinicia solo cuando se instala la actualización.
